B.a9F=new A.hq("Allah is more pleased with the repentance of His servant than a traveller who finds his lost camel again.","Sahih Muslim 2747 \u2014 summary",!1)
B.a9H=new A.hq("If you did not sin, Allah would replace you with a people who sin, seek forgiveness, and are forgiven.","Sahih Muslim 2749 \u2014 summary",!1)
