B.a9T=new A.hq("Allah accepts the repentance of His servant until the soul reaches the throat.","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3537 \u2014 hasan (Darussalam)",!1)
B.a9R=new A.hq("For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease. Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.","Quran 94:5\u20136",!1)
