B.a9P=new A.hq("\u2026Your Lord has decreed upon Himself mercy\u2026","Quran 6:54 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.a9A=new A.hq("\u2026My mercy encompasses all things\u2026","Quran 7:156 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.a9C=new A.hq("\u2026He called out within the darknesses, \u201cThere is no deity except You; exalted are You. Indeed, I have been of the wrongdoers.\u201d So We responded to him and saved him from the distress\u2026","Quran 21:87\u201388 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
