B.bvJ=new A.on("Eat of the Good Things","O people, eat from the earth what is lawful and good, and do not follow the footsteps of Shaytan (2:168). The halal plate is not a restriction list \u2014 it is an invitation to eat well, eat clean, and eat with gratitude.",u.oY)
B.bvE=new A.on("The Third of the Stomach","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the son of Adam does not fill any vessel worse than his stomach \u2014 a few morsels for his back to stand straight; if he must fill it, then a third for food, a third for drink, a third for breath (Tirmidhi 2380, sahih per Darussalam). The oldest diet advice in history, from the one who knew the body\u2019s design.",u.F)
B.bvH=new A.on("Sleep Is Worship\u2019s Fuel","The Prophet \ufdfa said: when one of you goes to bed, let him brush his hand over his bed \u2014 for he does not know what came upon it after him \u2014 then say: in Your name, my Lord, I lay down my side (Bukhari 6320). Sleep entered the sunna; the night is not a waste, it is the deposit of the morning\u2019s prayer.",u.s)
B.bvI=new A.on("Moderation in All Things","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the religion is ease (Bukhari 39). And he fasted but did not fast continuously; he prayed but he slept; he worked but he rested. Extremism in worship is not devotion \u2014 it is a debt the body will collect.",u.kF)
B.aHq=s([B.bvJ,B.bvE,B.bvH,B.bvI],t.Qt)
B.bvM=new A.KZ("The Body as an Amanah","Your body is a trust \u2014 you did not build it, you were lent it. The Prophet \ufdfa said: your body has a right over you (Bukhari 1975).",B.aHq)
B.bvL=new A.on("The Prophet\u2019s Own Ruqyah","The Prophet \ufdfa taught someone in pain to place a hand on the spot that hurts, say bismillah three times, then say seven times: I seek refuge in Allah\u2019s might and power from the evil of what I feel and fear (Muslim 2202). The cure begins with refuge, not with the symptom.",u.e_)
B.bvF=new A.on("The Evil Eye Is Real \u2014 and Curable","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the evil eye is real, and if anything were to overtake the divine decree, it would be the evil eye (Muslim 2188). And he taught the cure: the mu\u2019awwidhat (the last three surahs) recited over the afflicted. The protection is not paranoia; it is a sunna carried lightly.","When you admire something \u2014 your child, your home, your health \u2014 say mashallah, la quwwata illa billah. Guard the blessing by naming its Owner.")
B.bvD=new A.on("When Medicine and Faith Meet","The Prophet \ufdfa said: Allah did not send down a disease without sending down its cure (Bukhari 5678). Use the medicine \u2014 the ruqyah does not cancel the doctor; the doctor does not cancel the ruqyah. Seeking treatment is not weak faith; it is the sunna.",u.iW)
B.aO_=s([B.bvL,B.bvF,B.bvD],t.Qt)
B.bvO=new A.KZ("Ruqyah \u2014 the Qur\u2019an as Medicine","And We send down of the Qur\u2019an that which is healing and mercy for the believers (17:82). The verses are medicine; the reciter is the patient.",B.aO_)
B.bvK=new A.on("The Day of the Heart\u2019s Surgery","The day when neither wealth nor children will avail, except one who comes to Allah with a sound heart (26:88-89). Every practice in this school \u2014 food, sleep, ruqyah, moderation \u2014 is finally aimed here. The sound heart is the only luggage that boards.",u.ek)
B.bvG=new A.on("Dhikr Is the Heart\u2019s Food","Those who remember Allah standing, sitting, and on their sides (3:191). The heart without dhikr is the body without food \u2014 it does not die loudly; it just grows numb. The morning and evening adhkar are the three meals of the soul.",u.jX)
B.aEi=s([B.bvK,B.bvG],t.Qt)
B.bvN=new A.KZ("The Heart\u2019s Health","The body\u2019s final organ is the heart \u2014 and it has diseases with cures the Qur\u2019an names.",B.aEi)
B.aJx=s([B.bvM,B.bvO,B.bvN],A.ad("z<KZ>"))
